{"id":"n14759-2-7","stage":3,"title":"독립 · 单独","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14759-2-7-1","ko":"민준 씨 회사는 아버지로부터 물려받은 회사인가요?","zh":"敏俊先生，您公司是继承自您父亲的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}},{"text":"씨","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"회사는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사는","audio":"/audio/07eea830806c343675fd.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지로부터","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；로부터：表示时间、地点、对象等的起点：“从……”。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지로부터","audio":"/audio/6022ca2381e3424a43f5.mp3"}},{"text":"물려받은","meaning":"继承，接手","explanation":"물려받다：继承，接手；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"물려받다","audio":"/audio/69105aebecc7e1b73978.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56210","senseId":"1","lemma":"물려받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물려받은","audio":"/audio/084e8372a97e8fd5c652.mp3"}},{"text":"회사인가요?","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사인가요","audio":"/audio/1437335e37b65283f97d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"69105aebecc7e1b7","term":"물려받다","zh":"继承，接手","audio":"/audio/69105aebecc7e1b73978.mp3","entryId":"56210","definition":"从父母或祖辈处接受传下来的财产、职业、地位等。","pronunciation":["물려받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3817ba1038cbf48a1b1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14759-2-7-2","ko":"아니요, 제가 혼자서 세운 독립 회사입니다.","zh":"不是，这是我独自创办的独立公司。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자서","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独；서：接在人数表达等后，强调这些人是动作的主体，如 혼자서（独自）。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자서","audio":"/audio/870e79ede59f7c40d822.mp3"}},{"text":"세운","meaning":"建，建立","expl